.TH RGB 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rgb \- Build an opaque Color from red, green and blue (0..255 each); alpha is 255
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtypes.h\(dq
.BI "Color rgb(uint8_t r, uint8_t g, uint8_t b);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Build an opaque Color from red, green and blue (0..255 each); alpha is 255.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the Color.
.SH MODULE
types (src/engine/types/types.h)
